{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（27日）早上9時54分，警方接報葵涌大窩口邨富強樓有人從高處墮下。人員到場發現一名男子倒臥地上，經檢驗證實已告身亡。</p><p>據知，死者年約80歲。警方正調查死者身份及墮樓原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"警方接報葵涌大窩口邨富強樓有人從高處墮下。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260627/1147497500794949632837021.jpeg/wZcw9OTTuEN1eIQnyIXy9CbS1g0RelbXdKkBVV6pAVU\"/><figcaption>警方接報葵涌大窩口邨富強樓有人從高處墮下。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一名男子倒臥地上，經檢驗證實已告身亡。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260627/1147497497842028544761895.jpeg/HzUyau6B_lWOFbbF49yewNRsw_83Np1WFTbz2T8289k\"/><figcaption>一名男子倒臥地上，經檢驗證實已告身亡。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是大窩口邨。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260627/1147497492410142720249857.jpeg/ME4S8mI_vmRXGECTxaXLIfoJApd5f9tTerdV8lC3VfI\"/><figcaption>現場是大窩口邨。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260627/1147497489566273536410738.jpeg/uHNPxGZEqZmjRtJcau8V3cTfEg903eXSpbL2X4-y9l8\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-27T03:38:16.152920+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}